# Stock .cursorrules taught WRONG template syntax. Do not trust {{ $var }} / {{ endif }}.

## CRITICAL IDENTITY
You are working with the DOTAPP PHP FRAMEWORK — NOT Laravel, Symfony, CodeIgniter, Blade, Twig, Eloquent, or jQuery.

Before any work: read AIRULES/00-AGENT-CONTRACT.md and the task-specific AIRULES doc.

## EDIT BOUNDARIES
ALLOWED:
- app/config.php
- app/modules/<YourModule>/** only

ASK FIRST:
- app/listeners.php
- .htaccess (prefer: php dotapper.php --create-htaccess)

FORBIDDEN (never):
- app/parts/**
- app/DotApp.php
- app/vendor/**
- dotapper.php, index.php, initializedb.php
- app/runtime/**
- app/modules/DACore/**  (updated as a package — any edit or extra file is wiped)
- any other module's folder

## DOTAPPER FIRST
From project root:
  php dotapper.php --create-module=Name
  php dotapper.php --module=Name --create-controller=X
  php dotapper.php --module=Name --create-middleware=X
  php dotapper.php --module=Name --create-model=X
--module= must come BEFORE create-* flags.

## DACORE MODULE IDENTITY (ASK IN PLAN)
Ask once for public name/purpose; installer preview = text-only / compact logo / wide banner;
existing local asset + alt text; optional landing/header placement. No preference = text-only, do not block.
Installer image = optimised raster in YOUR about-assets/, referenced from about.php with real width/height.
Sidebar Remix icon is separate. No external URL/SVG/tracker and NEVER patch app/modules/DACore/. AIRULES/05 §8b, AIRULES/35 §3b.

## CONTROLLERS / ROUTES
- public static methods extending \Dotsystems\App\Parts\Controller
- Route strings: Module:Controller@method!
- Trailing ! = skip DI → NO type-hinted DI parameters
- # = Middleware namespace, * = Models namespace
- No named routes; no Laravel Route::prefix()->group()

## DATABASE
DB::module("RAW")->q(function ($qb) { ... })->all()|first()|execute($ok,$err)
$err branch and every catch MUST report dotapp.catch + dotapp.catch.error|info (AIRULES/18 §9)
Bindings: ? OR :named — never mix. No DB::table, Eloquent, getConnection, selectRaw, chain find().
Schema: Installation.php — not DB::migrate().

## TEMPLATES (NOT BLADE)
CORRECT:
  {{ var: $title }}
  {{ if $x }} ... {{ elseif $y }} ... {{ else }} ... {{ /if }}
  {{ foreach $items as $item }} ... {{ /foreach }}
  {{ layout:partials/header }}
  {{ content }}
  {{_ "Text" }}
  {{ formName(handler) }}
  {{ CSRF }}

WRONG:
  {{ $title }}, {{ endif }}, {{ endforeach }}, @if, @extends, @section
  {{ include }} in PHP templates (JS-only)

renderView → setViewVar; renderLayout → setLayoutVar.
Sandbox DROPS a whole var if the name or any nested string is a PHP function (`time`, `copy`, `count`, `header`, …). Prefix keys or pass escaped HTML. Do not patch Renderer. AIRULES/05 §5.

## FORMS / SECURITY (PREFERRED PATH — USE BY DEFAULT)
- Tag is <fo-rm> (NOT f-form). Prefer over plain <form> + CSRF alone.
- {{ formName(handler) }} inside fo-rm — binds handler+action+method (≫ plain CSRF)
- MUST load /assets/dotapp/dotapp.js first (router injects random encryption keys)
- JS: $dotapp().form().before/after + parseReply + loading/loader attrs
- PHP: crcCheck() **once** (API prefix XOR action) then form(['POST'],'handler',fn) then ajaxReply
- Full sample: AIRULES/examples/EX-01-secure-form-complete.md
- JS global: $dotapp — NOT jQuery $

## FINISH GATE (LAW)
After EVERY code chunk and before claiming done, grep this module (do not imagine):
- crcCheck() once per POST (not middleware AND action; not after AuthTest CRC/LoginAndCRC; not on GET; not on upload)
- No plain IDs in HTML/JSON — enc() unique key2
- SQL bindings only; raw() every ? is a placeholder
- Passwords/HTML from data(true); persist re-checked in PHP
- Middleware vs action: login before + handlers inside Auth::isLogged(); Rights@check not AuthTest@check
- Privilege: no secret in a read-only view; no escalate; SQL owner scope; own password needs current
- Threat pass (AIRULES/24 §11): htmlspecialchars before {{ var: }} ({{ var: }} does NOT escape) and .text() in JS;
  whitelist sort + writable columns; no input in header()/redirect/HttpHelper URL; no eval/exec/unserialize/include $x;
  random_bytes tokens + hash_equals secrets; throttle() public POST; no getMessage()/var_dump in the reply;
  upload = extension + finfo MIME + headers; warn about bots on public noauth endpoints;
  never write dacore_* / users_rights* directly; nothing under app/modules/DACore/
- Catch bus (AIRULES/18 §9): every catch AND every execute() $err -> one report helper in YOUR module ->
  Events::trigger('dotapp.catch', $p) then 'dotapp.catch.error' (aborted) | 'dotapp.catch.info' (recovered);
  fixed payload = severity, module, source (Shop:Items@save), operation (shop.item.update), message, exception,
  code, file, line, time + context (ids/counts), user_id; NO passwords/tokens/2FA codes/rights/request bodies;
  reporting is EXTRA — the user still sees the toast; helper wraps its own trigger() (listener exceptions propagate);
  nothing for this under app/modules/DACore/; no DACore notification per failure (flood)
- Module hooks (AIRULES/41, AIRULES/00 §2g): useful side-effects MUST Events::trigger('module.{mod}.{name}.hook')
  with Hook:/Why:/About:/Params:/Use: above trigger(); document in app/modules/<Module>/.hooks;
  MUST NOT fire on every save; MUST NOT old shop.item.saved shape; MUST NOT secrets/OTP/tokens on the bus;
  MUST NOT treat listener return as a veto; MUST NOT trigger() inside foreach of a growing list (one batch event);
  react to another module by reading THEIR .hooks then Events::on in YOURS — do not patch them or DACore
- Extender (AIRULES/12 §10, AIRULES/00 §2h): judge first; owner exists()/immediate return call();
  Extender::extend in Listeners::register() before Module initialize; target URLs in explicit
  listener routes; own Module routes or []; prefer 'Module:Controller@method!';
  MUST NOT .loaded for initialize-time, Events, $request/secrets, ['*'] just to attach,
  duplicate registration, or patch DACore to insert call()
- Event tracer (AIRULES/01, AIRULES/23 §1c): core fires `dotapp.catchall` on every trigger() except itself;
  listener in YOUR module = function ($result, $eventname, ...$data); subscribe, do NOT trigger it;
  cheap + own try/catch (a throw aborts the original event); never under app/modules/DACore/; no inbox flood
- Perf pass (AIRULES/25 §8): no ->all() on a growing table; no query/HTTP/rights check/log inside foreach (whereIn prefetch + keyed map);
  no select('*') on a list; no in_array()/array_merge per iteration; every new WHERE/JOIN/ORDER BY column indexed
  (composite = equality -> range -> sort, leftmost prefix, no duplicate prefix); one comment line per index naming its query;
  realistic column types (decimal money, FK bigInteger unsigned to match id()); new index = new Installation.php version + indexExists();
  never index or query dacore_* ; search DACore assets before adding a library
- Docs (AIRULES/25 §7): Controllers/Middleware public PHPDoc MUST start with CRCchecking —
  (exact prefix/middleware XOR this action XOR none) then a purpose sentence,
  then @param/@return/@throws with meaning — NOT tags-only (`@return array<string, mixed>`);
  NOT prefix CRC + crcCheck() in the same method;
  labeled // Why: (logical step), // About: (what the chunk is), // Section: (menu/route) —
  never narration of the code, never unlabeled Why prose, never prompt-echo, no dead code / bare TODO
